COMPILATION OF: E52PA

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52PA

   1 a 0000 E52PA: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E52PA (EXACT LOAN2 stmt 115 mirror; EVIDENCE ONLY: the
   3 a 0006       fixed-bin expression item stays refused on MINE at P3-3;
   4 a 0006       PA bytes are NEVER claimed this subround (P3-4 owns it)) */
   5 c 0006    dcl f file, m fixed binary, y fixed binary;
   6 c 0006    m = 1; y = 2;
   7 c 0010    put file(f) skip edit('|',100*m+y)(a,p'99/99');
   8 a 004B end E52PA;

CODE SIZE = 004E
DATA AREA = 0013
FREE SYMS = 3885
END  COMPILATION
